#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:1
#: d8835b4aac8a4665bb29bac7783697e4
msgid "最远点采样：从候选池挑代表结构"
msgstr "Farthest-Point Sampling: Select Representative Structures"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:3
#: 7ba5ed92b320447895321bcd244f9975
msgid ""
"最远点采样（FPS）适合从大量相似候选结构中挑出一个更有代表性的子集。它只判断描述符距离，不判断结构是否合理；如果候选池里有原子重叠等坏结构，应先清洗，再做"
" FPS。"
msgstr ""
"Farthest-point sampling (FPS) selects a representative subset from a large "
"pool of similar candidate structures. It only considers descriptor distance, "
"not whether a structure is physically reasonable. Clean structures with "
"overlapping atoms or other defects before running FPS."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:5
#: e8777fe7f6f940138d73e580e241bee9
msgid "1. 打开描述符图"
msgstr "1. Open the descriptor plot"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:7
#: 9ee324261eeb4d0fbf0b2d63e706f7e0
msgid ""
"在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中打开清洗后的候选结构和可用于计算描述符的 `nep.txt`。双击 `descriptor` "
"小图，把它切换到主图区，然后点击 `Sparse samples`。"
msgstr ""
"In `NEP Dataset Display`, open the cleaned candidate structures and a "
"`nep.txt` that can calculate their descriptors. Double-click the `descriptor` "
"thumbnail to move it into the main plot, then click `Sparse samples`."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:9
#: 4aff77c6e7684bda9d4ab1a7b754378d
msgid "描述符图和最远点采样入口"
msgstr "Descriptor plot and the farthest-point sampling action"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:9
#: 4aff77c6e7684bda9d4ab1a7b754378d
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/fps_sampling_entry.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/fps_sampling_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:14
#: a237c94101fd46f6b7b7539a408e1795
msgid "2. 第一次这样设置"
msgstr "2. Use these settings for your first run"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:16
#: 7180532953c448d99f79121273c50987
msgid "下面的示例从 25 个同类结构中挑 8 个："
msgstr "The following example selects 8 structures from a pool of 25 similar candidates:"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:18
#: ef8bda4a91284a9ea31aa811ea9f4f56
msgid "最远点采样设置窗口"
msgstr "Farthest-point sampling settings"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:18
#: ef8bda4a91284a9ea31aa811ea9f4f56
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_sparse_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_sparse_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:23
#: 37ba9b7683f340e08ac308fa70265807
msgid "`Selection strategy` 选择 `Global FPS`。它适合同一元素集合的候选池。"
msgstr "Set `Selection strategy` to `Global FPS`. This is suitable when all candidates have the same element set."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:24
#: 1aa52e87eaba4b00acfb287fd06394d6
msgid "`Sampling mode` 选择 `Fixed count (FPS)`，`Sample limit` 填计划保留的结构数，例如 `8`。"
msgstr "Set `Sampling mode` to `Fixed count (FPS)`, then enter the number of structures to retain in `Sample limit`, such as `8`."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:25
#: 93b45eebedb244a2b3a1905605082b92
msgid "`Min distance` 先用当前默认值 `0.01`。描述符尺度取决于模型；如果最终不足 8 个，说明距离条件过严，应调小后重试。"
msgstr "Start with the current `Min distance` default of `0.01`. Descriptor scales depend on the model. If fewer than 8 structures are selected, the distance threshold is too strict; reduce it and try again."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:26
#: 6f913eaea1c84877a8e17d4c3da1d16e
msgid "`Descriptor source` 选择 `Reduced (PCA)`，其余高级选项先留空。"
msgstr "Set `Descriptor source` to `Reduced (PCA)` and leave the other advanced options empty for now."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:27
#: a241bbb18f66401ca561545b19694857
msgid "点击 `OK`。"
msgstr "Click `OK`."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:29
#: 9e9b8195cf094c408c768525863a5c7c
msgid ""
"如果候选池混合了不同元素集合，改用 `Element-set balanced FPS`。它会先给每个元素集合分配名额，因此 `Sample "
"limit` 不能小于元素集合数量。`Training dataset` 只在希望避开已有训练集覆盖区域时填写；第一次从单一候选池采样可以留空。"
msgstr ""
"If the candidate pool contains different element sets, use `Element-set "
"balanced FPS`. It allocates a quota to each element set, so `Sample limit` "
"must not be smaller than the number of element sets. Fill in `Training "
"dataset` only when you want to avoid regions already covered by an existing "
"training set. Leave it empty for a first pass over a single candidate pool."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:31
#: de22ad1b9f6c4839bdf6d0ddc7bbcb31
msgid "3. 导出选中的代表结构"
msgstr "3. Export the selected representative structures"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:33
#: 0041160c124a4f34a6141731e452fde0
msgid "最远点采样选中的八个代表结构"
msgstr "Eight representative structures selected by FPS"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:33
#: 0041160c124a4f34a6141731e452fde0
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/fps_sampling_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/fps_sampling_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:38
#: 1634ae22e6704b37af0a82500e6c6428
msgid "运行后检查底部状态栏：本例应显示 `Sel: 8`、`Unsel: 17`。图中红色点是选中的代表结构。"
msgstr "After the run, check the status bar. This example should show `Sel: 8` and `Unsel: 17`. The red points are the selected representative structures."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:40
#: 632f2b011cd44be1bb0edf494d03541a
msgid ""
"确认数量后，从顶部 `Save` 菜单选择 `Export Selected` 导出。不要点击 `Delete selected "
"items`，否则删除的正是刚选出的代表结构。"
msgstr ""
"After confirming the count, choose `Export Selected` from the `Save` menu. "
"Do not click `Delete selected items`, because that would delete the "
"representative structures you just selected."

#: ../../source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:42
#: f32b6bd58e384cd49fabc1fe892bb90f
msgid ""
"`Use current selection as region` "
"会改变选择含义：程序只在当前选区中采样，并把保留下来的代表点从选区中取消。这个选项方便随后删除选区内的冗余结构，但第一次使用时建议不要勾选。"
msgstr ""
"`Use current selection as region` changes the meaning of the selection: the "
"program samples only within the current selection and then deselects the "
"representative points it keeps. This is useful when you intend to delete the "
"remaining redundant structures in that region, but leave it unchecked for "
"your first run."
